        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "If this can help, from what I've been able to test, it would appear that abbreviation expansion is not activated when using `noremap`, but still works with a recursive mapping, although I also don't know if this an expected behavior or not.\r\nThanks for taking a look anyway !",
