        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This indeed looks like an issue on Vim side. I've created vim/vim#15820 to see if it can be resolved there. If not, I'll consider prepending `<C-]>` to mappings. The problem here is that it has to also check if the first character is not a keyword character, which is kind of costly.",
